myQuranMobi - Qur'an. Absolutely free application without the presence of integration ads. The application that will not leave you indifferent.

In myQuranMobi you can:
• Listen to the verses individually;
• Listen individual verses without the presence of the Internet, after downloading the verses once;
• Listen to the Qur'an in different languages: Arabic, Russian, English, French, Azerbaijani, Bosnian;
• Add rain and thunder effects to the reading of the Qur'an;
• Read the semantic translation, transliterations, tafseerrs of the Qur'an in different languages;
• Read word-by-word translations of the Qur'an;
• Memorize the Qur'an with the most convenient interface for this task;
• Add verses to favorites;
• Download verses in mp3 format;
• Conduct a local and global search for verses from the Koran in different languages;
• Share verses;
• Copy verses and tafseers;
• Listen to the Qur'an while reading some of the most popular reciters: Yasser ad-Dussar, Yaser Salamah, Salah al-Budair, Sahl Yassin, Muhammad Jibreel, Muhammad Ayyoub, Mohammad al-Tablaway, Muhammad al-Minshawi, Mahmud al-Banna, Khalid al-Qahtanee, Karim Mansoori, Ibrahim Akhdar, Saad al-Ghamadi, Fares Abbad, Aziz Alili, Akram al-Alaqimy, Ahmed Neana, Ahmed al-Ajamy, Abdullah al-Juhany, Abdul Basit, Mishari Rashid, Nassir al-Katami, Hani ar-Rifai, Abu Bakr ash-Shatri, Maher al-Muaikli, Khalifa at-Tunaiji, Saud ash-Shuraim, Abdullah Basfar, Ali al -Khuzaifi, Khalil al-Khusari, Ali Jabir, Ayman Suwayd, Bilalia Rashid, Salah Bukhatir;
• Read the Mushaf;
• Customize the application language, theme, audio player, mushaf and other settings for yourself;

Rate the application and leave feedback, it helps to promote the project.
Make du'a for those who develop this application and for those who contribute to it. May Allah bless you!
